bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+4 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +4 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Devotion\" title=\"Devotion\">Devotion +60</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Devotion\" title=\"Devotion\">Devotion +60</a>:</b> Passive: +60 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Positive (Healing) <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wizardry\" title=\"Wizardry\"> Wizardry III</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wizardry\" title=\"Wizardry\">Wizardry III</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer +75 maximum <a href=\"/page/Spell_point\" title=\"Spell point\">spell points</a>. <a href=\"/page/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a> and <a href=\"/page/Favored_Soul\" title=\"Favored Soul\">Favored Souls</a> gain up to double spell points from items.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a h